<p>qaid se chut ke aayi hai zainab<br />
sadme dil par uthaayi hai zainab<br />
qabr shah ki banaayi hai zainab<br />
kuch yathimou ko laayi hai zainab</p>

<p>kehti hai roke lo qabar bhaai<br />
qatm ab hogaya safar bhaai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>main hu zainab falak satayi hu<br />
tumse milne yahaan mai aayi hu<br />
aur lute qaafele ko laayi hu<br />
bhaai kya kya sitam uthaayi hu</p>

<p>shaam tak nange sar gayi zainab<br />
kyu na pahle hi mar gayi zainab<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>uth ke dekho to ek nazar bhaai<br />
tukde sadmou se hai jigar bhaai<br />
hogaya hai sufaid sar bhaai<br />
jhuk gayi hai meri kamar bhaai</p>

<p>waada poora mai kar ke aayi hu<br />
pusht par taaziyaane khaayi hu<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saare kunbe ko saath laayi thi<br />
mehnatou se ye ghar basaayi thi<br />
mai ne doulat ye maa se paayi thi<br />
hogayi dafn jo kamaayi thi</p>

<p>ab ho kyu kar meri basar bhaai<br />
haaye kis mu se jaau ghar bhaai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ab na uth ke yahaa se jaaungi<br />
qabr baalou se apne jhaadungi<br />
phool har subha mai chadhaaungi<br />
shama raatou ko mai jalaaungi</p>

<p>yu hi ho jaayegi basar bhaai<br />
kya kare jeeke nouha gar bhaai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gar koi pooche kis ki jaayi hai<br />
qabr kis ki ye tu banaayi hai<br />
mujh ko qismat kahungi laayi hai<br />
mai bahan hu ye mera bhaai hai</p>

<p>the nabi ke ye maan-ne waale<br />
aur musalmaa'n the maarne waale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya bataaun shaheed ki haalat<br />
tan tha zaqmi thi dhoop ki shiddat<br />
aur namaazi pa pyaas ki shiddat<br />
sar uthaane ki bhi na di mohlat</p>

<p>dafn is jaa hai naamhar bhaai<br />
de diya raah-e- haq me sar bhaai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>thi muqaddar me mere ruswaayi<br />
kyu na darbaar hi me mout aayi<br />
pesh-e-haakim gayi ye dukh paayi<br />
ghussa aaya tha pee gayi bhaai</p>

<p>jo huwe zulm seh gayi zainab<br />
sab ke rone ko reh gayi zainab<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>